    (description . "Implement the first semantic vertical slice as original .my code: 64-cell position, move representation, pseudo-legal generation, king-safety filtering, apply-move, terminal state, and deterministic perft depth 1..3 fixtures. Start with vectors; do not add Rust bit primitives before profiling.")))

